<title>SRI LANKA: Royal Ceramic says 12-mth net up 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Royal Ceramic says 12-mth net up 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in millions of rupees unless states)</p>
<p>			   1997		   1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	   472.87		 322.20</p>
<p>    Net profit	  74.17		  67.87</p>
<p>Note - Results are unaudited. Royal Ceramics Lanka Ltd manufactures and distributed ceramic tiles and ceramic ware.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom</p>
</text>
